>And she disapears taking NOTHING.  Needless to say, I'm very happy, 
>but...what's going on here???? 

Succubi/incubi don't steal objects from you; they just remove your clothing
to get "close and personal..."  Sometimes this close encounter improves your
stats, sometimes it does the opposite, and usually (if you allow them to
do what they want) they will take gold for services rendered (which you can
get back by killing them...)

